    "benchmark_md": "Four peers were selected and locked during the research phase (GATE_B1) for SV-04 community bank comparability: Arrow Financial Corporation (AROW, $4.3B assets), Canandaigua National Corporation (~$2.3B, private), Financial Institutions Inc / Five Star Bank (FISI, $6.1B), and Evans Bancorp (EVBN, $2.2B). All four operate in overlapping NYS geography with comparable community banking mandates and trust/wealth capabilities. Peers were scored at category level (17 categories x 4 peers = 68 scored data points) and peer medians computed for all 17 categories. Peer scores are immutable for this assessment.",
